            },
            "description": "Upsert on (astronaut, date). First post for a date creates the log (201); later posts for the same date update only the fields you send (200). Every value is optional. The response adds `vitals_status`: GREEN/AMBER/RED/UNKNOWN + guidance for heart rate, blood pressure, sleep and mood.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"astronaut\": {{astronaut_id}},\n  \"date\": \"2026-11-14\",\n  \"resting_hr_bpm\": 64,\n  \"systolic_mmhg\": 118,\n  \"diastolic_mmhg\": 76,\n  \"sleep_hours\": 6.0,\n  \"mood\": 3,\n  \"sodium_mg\": 3400,\n  \"exercise_min\": 90\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
